}

docs {
  OPD equivalent of the lab **Clone Lab Panel List** endpoint (POST /branch-opd-panel-lists/:id/clone).
  
  Deep-copy a panel list (panels + member tests, preserving `listPrice`) into a
  new independent list.
}
